# Default: no TLS listener. The mirror serves plain http only, exactly as before.
#
# Mounted at /etc/caddy/tls_listen.caddy by docker-compose.cdn.yaml. Switch to
# listen-enabled.caddy (and generate certs) to add https. Kept as two files rather
# than one conditional because an ssl certificate pointing at a missing file
# makes Caddy refuse to start.
